{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05491","headline":"山行见孤松成咏 · 张宣明","name":"山行见孤松成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤松郁山椒，肃爽凌清霄。\n既挺千丈干，亦生百尺条。\n青青恒一色，落落非一朝。\n大厦今已构，惜哉无人招。\n寒霜十二月，枝叶独不凋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张宣明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}